WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.730
I flew so close to Jupiter that its gravity flung me across the solar system to Saturn.

2
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.790
I was the first visitor to the ringed planet.

3
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:21.660
I scouted the path that the Voyagers would follow. My power faded in 1995.

4
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.000
I showed you Saturn first.
